<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1158].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1158&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;GHIORSEA BIVORA MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Artificial saltwater (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=629">629</a>)             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Wolfe's mineral solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=265">265</a>)        </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaHCO<sub>3</sub>                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.68&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components thoroughly.  Gas with N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (4:1, v/v) to establish pH 6.5.  Dispense the medium in culture vessels (e.g., 20 ml in 30 ml serum bottles) under the same gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  After cooling add per liter the following solution (filter-sterilized):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Modified trace vitamins (see below)                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Prior to inoculation, add filter-sterilized 5% H<sub>2</sub> and 5% air to the gas phase (by volume).  Incubate statically.  Replenish H<sub>2</sub> and air every two days.  <br>
Modified trace vitamins: <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Biotin                                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Folic acid                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Pyridoxine&#183;HCl                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Thiamine&#183;HCl                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Riboflavin                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Nicotinic acid                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> DL-Calcium pantothenate                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin B<sub>12</sub>                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> <I>p</I>-Aminobenzoic acid                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Lipoic acid                                             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;5.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KH<sub>2</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.9&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L        </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
